&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Clear written communication and comfort working across Security, IT, Engineering, Legal, and Finance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
